1036:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortCpltCallback()
1037:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortTransmitCpltCallback()
